# =============================================================================
# AI & Agent Workspace
# =============================================================================
# These are SHARED project config, not machine state: a repository commits its
# agents, skills and settings so every collaborator (and the cloud session) gets
# them. Only the per-machine files inside them are ignored. `vibeflow.json` is
# not listed at all — neither the project's root config nor
# `.vibeflow/vibeflow.json` — because both are the project's to keep.
.claude/settings.local.json
.cursor/
.aider/
.continue/
.copilot/

